<title>HUNGARY: CESI index closes at 1,710.45 pts, up 4.97.</title>
<headline>CESI index closes at 1,710.45 pts, up 4.97.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index rose 0.29 percent or 4.97 points to finish at 1,710.45 points on Friday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
